<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE-San Francisco Airport $118 mln.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE-San Francisco Airport $118 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>RE: $118,500,000</p>
<p>SAN FRANCISCO</p>
<p>SAN FRANCISCO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT, CALIFORNIA</p>
<p>SECOND SERIES REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>ISSUE 13 AND ISSUE 14</p>
<p>Effective at 9:15 A.M. E.S.T., Wednesday, November 20, 1996</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>on the term bonds, and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
